\n\r\nThis change fixes the contextual buttons behavior on parts of the inspector and project/editor settings:\r\n- the keyframe, revert, delete buttons and checkbox on `EditorProperty` (checkbox visible on theme overrides, delete visible on custom metadata)\r\n- the keyframe button and Enable checkbox on `EditorInspectorSection`\r\n\r\nList of corrections done in this commit:\r\n- Buttons and checkboxes now wait for a mouse button up event to trigger, instead of triggering on the mouse button down alone. This is standard GUI behavior on discrete action buttons, and gives one last chance to \"escape\" before triggering the action by dragging away before releasing the mouse button.\r\n- Button icons use the actual editor theme colors, instead of hardcoded values.\r\n- The pressed state while the mouse button is held down is added, according to the editor theme.\r\n- On EditorProperty, the button area is made non-draggable.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull 